lisa-design:
- policy_data is stored from ConfigureRequest only (InitRequest has no policy_data); it is set after a successful Configure and cleared (nil) when unset, matching plugin-file-attestation#7.
- TestConfigureStoresPolicyData runs the real Configure against an httptest GitLab server (base_url) because Configure resolves the group over the API.
- Pre-existing staticcheck SA1019 (ApprovalsBeforeMerge deprecated, main.go) is left as is: not introduced here, and CI lints only new issues.
